        <elementInformation name="designation" show="1">Sigen Gateway HomePro SP</elementInformation>
        <elementInformation name="description" show="1">gateway/backup; komunikacija: 2x FE (RJ45), RS485 (rezervirano), DI1 (bypass), DI2 (ATS), DO1 (omrežni kontaktor), DO2 (kontaktor agregata), DO3 (2-žilni zagon agregata)</elementInformation>
        <elementInformation name="notes" show="1">Viri: Datasheet - Sigen Energy Gateway HomePro (SP / SP-F / TP), Version 20260618, Sigenergy str. 2; Sigen Gateway HomePro SP Installation Guide, v03 (2026-01-16); iz ZIP Sigen Gateway HomePro SP Installer Manual_EN.zip str. 2 (Port Description), 3 (notranjost KM1/KM2/QS1/QF), 5 (kabli), 11-15 (priključki, QF3 ali QF4), 16 (komunikacija); Sigen Energy Gateway Home Series User Manual, v08 (2026-06-05) str. 25-27 (HomePro SP), 33-35 (HomeMax SP), 36-38 (HomeMax SP 12K), 55-57 (HomePro TP), 59-61 (HomeMax TP) - risbe mer; Application Note - How to connect the Generator to Sigen Energy Gateway</elementInformation>
        <elementInformation name="mass_kg" show="1">25</elementInformation>
        <elementInformation name="width" show="1">450</elementInformation>
        <elementInformation name="height" show="1">570</elementInformation>
        <elementInformation name="depth" show="1">197</elementInformation>
    </elementInformations>
    <informations>Viri: Datasheet - Sigen Energy Gateway HomePro (SP / SP-F / TP), Version 20260618, Sigenergy str. 2; Sigen Gateway HomePro SP Installation Guide, v03 (2026-01-16); iz ZIP Sigen Gateway HomePro SP Installer Manual_EN.zip str. 2 (Port Description), 3 (notranjost KM1/KM2/QS1/QF), 5 (kabli), 11-15 (priključki, QF3 ali QF4), 16 (komunikacija); Sigen Energy Gateway Home Series User Manual, v08 (2026-06-05) str. 25-27 (HomePro SP), 33-35 (HomeMax SP), 36-38 (HomeMax SP 12K), 55-57 (HomePro TP), 59-61 (HomeMax TP) - risbe mer; Application Note - How to connect the Generator to Sigen Energy Gateway
